====Usage notes====
Cherry includes, but is not limited to, the following [[species]], of the [[genus]] {{taxfmt|Prunus|genus}}: {{taxfmt|Prunus avium|species}} ([[wild cherry]], [[mazzard]], [[sweet cherry]]), ''[[Prunus cerasus|P. cerasus]]'' ([[sour cherry]]), {{taxfmt|Prunus mahaleb|species}} ([[mahaleb cherry]], {{vern|rock cherry}}), {{taxlink|Prunus pensylvanica|species|P. pensylvanica}} ({{vern|pin cherry}}, [[bird cherry]]), {{taxlink|Prunus pumila|species|P. pumila}} ([[sand cherry]]), ''[[Prunus serotina|P. serotina]]'' ([[black cherry]]), {{taxlink|Prunus serrulata|species|P. serrulata}} ({{vern|Japanese flowering cherry}}, {{vern|hill cherry}}), and ''[[Prunus virginiana|P. virginiana]]'' ([[chokecherry]]). {{taxfmt|Prunus|genus}} also includes [[plum]]s, [[peach]]es, [[apricot]]s, and [[almond]]s.

